      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Daten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fertig"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finding your programs": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sucht deine Programme"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Found your programs": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine Programme gefunden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It came with wizards bot install. The app starts it and uses it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Er kam mit wizards bot install. Die App startet ihn und verwendet ihn."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is older than the app's, which is version %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Er ist älter als der Bot Server der App, Version %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is version %@, the app carries %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Er hat Version %1$@, die App bringt %2$@ mit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It stops and no longer starts with your Mac. Your agents, conversations and paired phones are in %@; kept there, a Bot Server started later finds them again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Er hält an und startet nicht mehr mit deinem Mac. Deine Wizards, Gespräche und verbundenen Telefone liegen in %@; bleiben sie dort, findet ein später gestarteter Bot Server sie wieder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeping a copy of your data": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine Kopie deiner Daten wird angelegt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps working when the window is closed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arbeitet weiter, wenn das Fenster zu ist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept a copy of your data": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine Kopie deiner Daten ist angelegt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let the app run it": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Von der App betreiben lassen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let the app run your Bot Server?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soll die App deinen Bot Server betreiben?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not connected": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nicht verbunden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing answers at this address. Is the Bot Server running?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unter dieser Adresse antwortet nichts. Läuft der Bot Server?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OK": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OK"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Offer": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anbieten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Offer this Mac's models": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Modelle dieses Macs anbieten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Offer this Mac's models…": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Modelle dieses Macs anbieten …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Offer to a Bot Server…": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Einem Bot Server anbieten …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Offered to %@, which is out of reach now. The link tries again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Angeboten an %@, der gerade nicht erreichbar ist. Die Verbindung versucht es wieder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Offered to %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Angeboten an %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once more": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Noch einmal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only if macOS asks: turn on wizards under Login Items.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nur wenn macOS fragt: Schalte wizards unter Anmeldeobjekte ein."
